      "associationCertaintyURI": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/association-certainty/certain",
      "start": -720,
      "details": "<p>Lilbur-i\u0161\u0161ak-A\u0161\u0161ur is the ceremonial name of the\u00a0A\u0161\u0161ur Gate in Akkadian inscriptions of Sennacherib dated to 697-695 and 691 B.C.</p>",
